    "description": "Enjoy the traditional taste of Casa Mamita Mild Salsa on your next taco night. This delicious blend of tomatoes, onions and jalapenos makes an irresistible mild salsa option. Enjoy with tortilla chips, on top of tacos, burritos, meat, and nachos, or even use to marinate chicken or beef for an extra kick of flavor. The mild flavor means you can enjoy as much as you want without feeling the heat. Discover all of our delicious salsa and Mexican food ingredients at affordable prices when you stop in.",
