    "description": "Casa Mamita Chunky Medium Salsa from ALDI is the perfect balance between spicy and mild. It's a delicious mix of tomato, jalapeno, and onion flavors that is irresistible. This 24 oz jar of medium salsa can be used with way more than just chips. Grab a spoonful and add it to your morning scrambled eggs; top off tacos, quesadillas, or fajitas. Even simmer it with your slow cooker chicken. Whatever dish your heart desires, Casa Mamita can help bring your meal together. Discover all of our delicious and affordable pantry options at ALDI.",
